meta {
  name: Cloud Drive API
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
  token: {{authToken}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  base_url: http://localhost:9000/api/v1
  authToken: 
}

docs {
  ## Authentication
  Cookie-based auth: Login first — the server sets an HttpOnly cookie automatically.
  For Bruno (non-browser), the Login post-response script captures the token from
  the response body and stores it in {{authToken}}, which is sent as Bearer on all
  subsequent requests via collection-level auth.
}
